+/*
+ * Windows also describes an audio companion (\_SB.ADSP.SLM1.ADCM.AUDD) on
+ * SPI4/CS0 with MBHC and audio-adapter children.  Its interrupt is delivered
+ * through the qcgpio/PDC event space instead of a plain TLMM GPIO, so it is
+ * left undescribed for now.  Speakers and headset are handled by the WCD9340
+ * on SLIMbus.
